  "observations": [
    "Both full @2 cohorts win 01 and 03 and lose 02 and 04. All eight attempts complete with integrity 1 and no rejected actions.",
    "Opus 02 uses Cannon (3.5,11.5), Fireball (3.4,10), Minions (3.2,8.5), but the Balloon takes its 305 HP tower at 5.3s. Its @1 attempt won with different play.",
    "Sol 02 uses Cannon (7,10); the Balloon takes its 305 HP tower at 1.85s, before another decision.",
    "Opus 04 uses Cannon (6.5,10.5), Fireball and Hog, then Log toward the enemy tower; its tower falls at 8.95s. Sol uses Cannon (7,10) and loses at 10.1s.",
    "The 04 reference uses Cannon (7,11.5), then a defensive Log and Ice Spirits, and wins with zero additional tower damage. Comparisons vary several decisions, so single-coordinate causal attribution is not established.",
    "Sol 03 is a terminal overtime HP-tiebreak win with no crown taken; the other three model wins destroy a tower."
